WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,120
Miss, you got up so early today

2
00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:04,720
It was you who got up late today

3
00:00:04,960 --> 00:00:06,120
The weather is bad

4
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:07,360
I can't sleep when it rains

5
00:00:07,360 --> 00:00:09,880
In winter, you can even sleep for a whole season. You are not allowed to tell anyone.

6
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:10,880
this is my secret

7
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:13,040
My brother won't let me tell anyone, he will pinch my face

8
00:00:13,040 --> 00:00:14,040
don't tell others

9
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:16,640
So have you found your brother? You have found him.

10
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,000
My brother told me to stay here and not move.

11
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,870
He'll be here soon, sister

12
00:00:24,110 --> 00:00:25,590
Sister, you are too cute

13
00:00:25,590 --> 00:00:27,150
Dear elders, don’t get me wrong

14
00:00:27,470 --> 00:00:29,110
It's just like what my brother said

15
00:00:29,110 --> 00:00:30,710
The alley is very noisy and people like it

16
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:32,740
This is a free gift from the store

17
00:00:32,740 --> 00:00:34,060
Disposable book washing supplies

18
00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:36,220
There are also men’s and women’s underwear if needed.

19
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:37,420
Can be purchased at the front desk

20
00:00:37,420 --> 00:00:39,220
Two new washing machines have been added to the bathroom

21
00:00:39,220 --> 00:00:40,740
It takes 5g to wash clothes

22
00:00:40,740 --> 00:00:42,300
We also sell laundry detergent in the lobby.

23
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:43,340
How is it possible

24
00:00:43,340 --> 00:00:44,660
Obviously it wasn't there yesterday

25
00:00:44,660 --> 00:00:46,390
Wow, I really have underwear

26
